{title: Deyale Deyale}
{artist: Minar}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Bolona,        [E]Keno tumi [F#m]bohudur
[E]Keno ami [D]eka,        [D]Hridoye [E]vangchur
[A]Jano na,        [E]Tumi hina e [F#m]amay
[E]Shopno meghe [D]dhaka,        [D]Name na [E]roddur
[Bm]Deyale [A]deyale,        [E]Kheyale [F#m]kheyale
[Bm]Hisebe [A]behisebe [E]tomakei khuji,        [Bm]Arale [A]arale
[E]Kothay [F#m]harale,        [Bm]Fire tumi [A]ar [E]ashbe na bujhi
[A]Koto raat,        [E]Kete geche [F#m]adhare
[E]Neito bhorer [D]dekha,        [D]Bojhabo [E]kivabe
[A]Koto ghum,        [E]Mishe geche [F#m]ojanay
[E]Jane sudhu [D]du chokh,        [D]Bhul se [E]shobhabe
[Bm]Deyale [A]deyale,        [E]Kheyale [F#m]kheyale
[Bm]Hisebe [A]behisebe [E]tomakei khuji,        [Bm]Arale [A]arale
[E]Kothay [F#m]harale,        [Bm]Fire tumi [A]ar [E]ashbe na bujhi
[C#m]Tobu ami [D]tomar opekkhaye,        [F#m]Dekhbo [C#m]notun diner [D]aalo.. [E]
[C#m]Beche thakar [D]ashroy tumi,        [F#m]Tumake [C#m]sudhu bashi [D]valo.. [E]
